Package: rswallpaper
Title: Wallpapers and Accent Colours for the 'RStudio' IDE
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ann", "Zhong", , "annzhong71@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Build custom 'RStudio' editor themes ('.rstheme' files) that
    place a semi-transparent image, such as a character illustration, in
    the source editor; re-tint the IDE chrome (tabs, toolbars, menus,
    selection, cursor) with an accent colour; or generate complete colour
    schemes from preset palettes or from the dominant colours of an image.
    Works on top of any installed theme and ships a 'shiny' gadget with a
    live preview plus 'RStudio' addins.
